<div class="section" style="padding:60px 0;">
  <div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-10 offset-lg-1">
    <h4>Who We Are</h4>
    <p>Carpe DM Strategies Ltd is a digital marketing and web development agency registered in England and Wales (Company No. 14900297). Our registered address is 246 Dunkery Road, London, SE9 4HW. We build websites, automation systems and growth strategies for trades businesses and small companies across the UK.</p>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:info@carpedmstrategies.co.uk">info@carpedmstrategies.co.uk</a></p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">What Data We Collect</h4>
    <p>When you use our website or contact us, we may collect: your name and contact details; business information submitted via our contact form; technical data such as IP address and pages visited via Google Analytics; and communications you send us.</p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">How We Use Your Data</h4>
    <p>We use your data to respond to enquiries, deliver services, improve our website, and meet legal obligations. We do not sell or share your data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">Legal Basis for Processing</h4>
    <p>We process your data under UK GDPR on the basis of contract (to deliver services), legitimate interests (to respond to enquiries), and consent where explicitly given.</p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">Cookies</h4>
    <p>We use Google Analytics cookies to understand how visitors use our site. You can opt out via your browser settings or the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out tool</a>.</p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">Data Retention</h4>
    <p>Enquiry data is retained for 24 months. Client project data is retained for 6 years in line with HMRC requirements.</p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">Your Rights</h4>
    <p>Under UK GDPR you have the right to access, correct or delete your personal data, and to lodge a complaint with the ICO at <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank">ico.org.uk</a>. Email us at <a href="mailto:info@carpedmstrategies.co.uk">info@carpedmstrategies.co.uk</a> to exercise any right.</p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">Third Party Services</h4>
    <p>We use Google Analytics and Google Ads for traffic analysis and advertising. Internal automation runs on self-hosted infrastructure.</p>
    <h4 style="margin-top:32px;">Changes</h4>
    <p>We may update this policy periodically. The current version will always be available at this URL.</p>
  </div></div></div>
